WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Night in Venice.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:07.050
A man tells his companion, quite
openly: "I am not what I am."

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.070
Then the reasons start.

4
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:10.890
Passed over for promotion.

5
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.770
A rumour about his wife.

6
00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.920
He loves Desdemona too.

7
00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:19.260
Then a rival who has "a
daily beauty in his life".

8
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:23.870
At the end, asked why, he
says only: "Demand me nothing.

9
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.080
What you know, you know."

10
00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.060
At least four motives.

11
00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.440
So why does none of them add up?

12
00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.950
In this mission, you'll line
up every motive Iago offers,

13
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.560
scene by scene.

14
00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:39.060
You'll see how his soliloquies
turn you into his confidant,

15
00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:42.270
and weigh critics who can't
agree what drives him.

16
00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:46.040
Your mission: explain why
none of his motives add up.
